// WHAT THE ATLAS RECEIPTS SAY THE MARKING IS AT EACH BOX THEY STATE, as rows: the receipt read this text at
// this box of this frame. It is the independent side of the reading-vs-receipt join
// (product.p4261.e1_receipt_join): a model reading's glyph span carries its own frame and box, and this table
// is what the receipts say was read there. A row means "the receipt read a marking at this box"; it does NOT
// mean "this box is the marking" -- a receipt `location` can state a package box and a label box, and every
// box it states is a row, exactly as in product.p4261.e1_board_sightings.
//
// GENERATED by gunbc-private p4261/e1-atlas-handoff, docs/plans/2026-11-03-p4261-e1-atlas/scripts/gen_e1_receipt_markings_dag.py
// at 515ad4791b5c; do not hand-edit. Reads per_photo_readings.jsonl and per_photo_readings_sd_2026-11-03.jsonl (E1
// frames only). Boxes come from the roster generator's own grammar (its boxes_of, imported, not re-implemented).
//
// THE RULE. A row per distinct (frame digest, box, marking text, designator) for each receipt item that states
// a NON-EMPTY marking. An empty marking emits no row; a marking with no box in the grammar emits no row; both
// are counted below by reason. `e1_receipt_frame_digests` lists every E1 receipt photo's digest, so a join can
// tell a frame with no receipt from a receipt with no marked item from a marked item at another box.
//
// COUNTS (from this run): 1055 rows, of which 537 from a structured bbox and 518 from parsed location text; 173
// receipt frames. NOT EMITTED / COLLAPSED, by reason: 187 x marking stated, no box in the receipts' grammar; 1145 x no marking stated (legibility none_printed); 1299 x no marking stated (legibility not_applicable); 417 x no marking stated (legibility not_visible); 331 x no marking stated (legibility unreadable).

type ReceiptLegibility
  = ReceiptClear
  | ReceiptPartial
  | ReceiptUnreadable
  | ReceiptNotVisible
  | ReceiptNonePrinted
  | ReceiptNotApplicable

type ReceiptMarking {
  frame: Sha256Digest
  region: PixelRegion
  box_source: BoxSource
  marking_text: NonEmptyStr
  marking_legibility: ReceiptLegibility
  designator: NonEmptyStr?
  photo_id: NonEmptyStr?
}

